# ce-reclaim-customization-media — webOS CE: once per flash, after the
# customization service has copied the staged wallpapers/ringtones to
# /media/internal, delete the rootfs STAGING copy (~25MB).
#
# Verify-then-flag, like ce-cryptofs-seed and ce-firstboot-tweaks: the
# staging copy is the ONLY other source, so it is not removed until the
# live copy has been confirmed present. A run that cannot confirm defers
# to the next trigger rather than burning the once-per-flash flag.

start on stopped finish
start on first-use-finished

console none

script
    exec sh -e /usr/palm/ce-seed/jobs/ce-reclaim-customization-media.sh
end script
